{"id":"male_diction","lemma":"malédiction","pos":"noun","rank":2379,"glosses":["spell, curse (supernatural detriment)"],"ipa":"/ma.le.dik.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-mal%C3%A9diction.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-mal%C3%A9diction.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"malédictions"},"formAudio":{"malédictions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-mal%C3%A9dictions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une malédiction.","en":"It's a curse.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je ne crois pas aux malédictions.","en":"I don't believe in curses.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Il marmonna une malédiction.","en":"He muttered a curse.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je vais lancer sur toi une malédiction.","en":"I'm going to put a curse on you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to throw"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La malédiction a été brisée.","en":"The curse was broken.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"broken","l":"brisé"}]}]}